@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About the Scary Cave</PageTitle>

<div>
    <h2 class="display-6">About the Scary Cave</h2>
    <p>This is a simple text-based adventure game. It is a work in progress!</p>
    <p>
        It was created to demonstrate some networking basics and to be some example code for the Computer Networks I &amp; II classes (CS-260 and CS-261).
    </p>
    <p>
        As such, it is not a complete game and may have some bugs or other issues; and is not intended to be
        a complete and polished product.
    </p>
    <br/>
    <h4 class="display-6">Interesting Technology:</h4>
    <ul class="tech-list">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/DigiPen-Network-Classes/ScaryCaves">This Project (Github)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/apps/aspnet">Asp.Net Core</a> for the Server</li>
        <li><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/orleans/overview">Microsoft Orleans</a> - for managing game state</li>
        <li><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/blazor/components/">ASP.NET Core Razor Components</a> and <a href="https://htmx.org">htmx</a> - server-rendered UI</li>
        <li><a href="https://redis.io">Redis</a> - Game Database</li>
    </ul>
    <br/>
</div>
